Fields.Description:
If set to true, an array compromised of the following object is required via HTTP upload:

* headers *(array)*
    * name *(string)*
    * value *(string)*
    * params *(object)*

* content *(string)*

Example:
[
  {
    "headers": [
      {
        "name": "Content-Transfer-Encoding",
        "value": "base64"
      },
      {
        "name": "Content-Type",
        "value": "application/octet-stream",
        "params": {
          "name": "test.txt"
        }
      }
    ],
    "content": "dGVzdAo="
  }
]
